msgstr "將檢視置中於選取的書籤"

msgid "Bookmarks for current graph"
msgstr "目前圖表的書籤"

msgid "Other Bookmarks"
msgstr "其他書籤"

msgid "Vertical spacing between generations"
msgstr "世代之間的垂直間距"

msgid "Horizontal spacing between generations"
msgstr "世代之間的水平間距"

msgid "Spacings"
msgstr "間距"

msgid "All connected"
msgstr "所有有連結的人物"

msgid ""
"Show all connected persons limited by generation restrictions.\n"
"Works slow, so don't set large generation values."
msgstr ""
"顯示世代限制範圍內所有有連結的人物。\n"
"執行速度較慢，請勿設定過大的世代數。"

msgid "Add active person"
msgstr "加入目前人物"

msgid "Call the bookmark editor"
msgstr "開啟書籤編輯器"

msgid ""
"You don't have any bookmarks yet...\n"
"Try to add some frequently used persons to speedup navigation."
msgstr ""
"您還沒有任何書籤...\n"
"試著加入一些常用人物，以加快導覽。"

msgid "No bookmarks for this graph..."
msgstr "此圖表沒有書籤..."

msgid "No other bookmarks..."
msgstr "沒有其他書籤..."

#, python-format
msgid "found: %s"
msgstr "找到：%s"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Add active person to bookmarks\n"
"%s"
msgstr ""
"將目前人物加入書籤\n"
"%s"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Person <b><i>%s</i></b> is not in the current view.\n"
"Do you want to set it active and rebuild view?"
msgstr ""
"人物 <b><i>%s</i></b> 不在目前檢視中。\n"
"要將其設為目前人物並重建檢視嗎？"

msgid "Change active person?"
msgstr "要變更目前人物嗎？"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This graph would contain at least {people_count} people, which exceeds the "
"limit of {people_limit} people. For performance reasons, at least "
"{people_missing} people won't be shown. You can change this limit in the "
"view configuration."
msgstr ""
"此圖至少會包含 {people_count} 個人物，超過 {people_limit} 人的上限。為維持效"
"能，至少有 {people_missing} 人不會顯示。您可以在檢視設定中變更此上限。"

msgid "Incomplete graph"
msgstr "不完整的關係圖"

msgid "Image on right side"
msgstr "圖片置於右側"

msgid "Image on left side"
msgstr "左側圖片"

