msgstr "此家庭沒有事件"

msgid "Select tags for family"
msgstr "選取家庭標籤"

msgid "Add father"
msgstr "新增父親"

msgid "Add mother"
msgstr "新增母親"

msgid "About Graph View"
msgstr "關於關係圖檢視"

